{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Oily Depths</strong> is a short horror game set in a submarine deep beneath the sea. You must locate and drill for oil or those who command you will stop your supply of oxygen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PILOT YOUR SUB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize all your gauges, meters, and monitors as your visibility is limited within the sub. Carefully navigate the sea floor to locate the oil extraction targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/31e765dda7f2b01918cb0f5ed041b157.poster.avif?t=1760431450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/31e765dda7f2b01918cb0f5ed041b157.webm?t=1760431450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/31e765dda7f2b01918cb0f5ed041b157.mp4?t=1760431450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPERATE DANGEROUS DRILLING MACHINERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip levers, grab tools, set locking-arms, and more. You will need to gain a mastery of each part of your equipment until it's a part of you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/c70c01818ea10433bf18d3a589cce93d.poster.avif?t=1760431450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/c70c01818ea10433bf18d3a589cce93d.webm?t=1760431450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113030/extras/c70c01818ea10433bf18d3a589cce93d.mp4?t=1760431450